    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nourish</strong> is a retro-styled 3D horror game about survival, responsibility, and the terrifying cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a junior employee of Echium Enterprises, you're tasked with transporting <i>Project V\u00e1yu</i> \u2014 a mysterious plant discovered on a distant alien world. Early research suggests it could solve Echium\u2019s oxygen shortage aboard deep-space vessels. But in isolation, far from home, you quickly realize the plant is growing... <i>hungry</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and dwindling resources carefully. Feed the plant. Maintain the ship. Survive.<br>Because if V\u00e1yu dies \u2014 you do too.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.poster.avif?t=1750783989\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.webp?t=1750783989\" class=\"bb_img\" width=188 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nourish</strong> is a retro-styled 3D horror game about survival, responsibility, and the terrifying cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a junior employee of Echium Enterprises, you're tasked with transporting <i>Project V\u00e1yu</i> \u2014 a mysterious plant discovered on a distant alien world. Early research suggests it could solve Echium\u2019s oxygen shortage aboard deep-space vessels. But in isolation, far from home, you quickly realize the plant is growing... <i>hungry</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time and dwindling resources carefully. Feed the plant. Maintain the ship. Survive.<br>Because if V\u00e1yu dies \u2014 you do too.<br> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.poster.avif?t=1750783989\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/84071e96bff803f31baf4a2584d2edbe.webp?t=1750783989\" class=\"bb_img\" width=188 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
